  },
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "Health and {fitness} help a person live a good and healthy life.Often due to various {pressures} , we tend to ignore our health.This makes our {body} suffer and we will catch {diseases} .It is the fitness level of our body that helps us fight these diseases.",
      "cn": "健康和 健身 有助于一个人过上健康美好的生活。通常由于各种 压力 ，我们往往会忽视自己的健康。这会让我们的 身体 遭受痛苦，并引发 疾病 。正是我们身体的健康水平帮助我们抵抗疾病。"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "Health and fitness are two frequently {discussed topics} in the modern world.They are {interrelated} to each other.We need to be fit to have a healthy body.Similarly, if we are healthy, we {shall naturally} be {attracted} towards {maintaining} the fitness of our body.Health is the state of our body at a given time.A {genuine} indicator ( (标志) ) of good health might be the absence of disease or {disability} , but we could still have a {weak} body, which is ready to be {targeted} by {viruses} .For {instance} , we may have a tendency to catch a {cold} easily.This does not {definitely} mean that we are not healthy.It means the fitness level is not in {accordance} with our age and the {climatic conditions} where we live.",
      "cn": "健康和健身是现代社会人们经常 讨论 的两个 话题 。它们 相互关联 。我们需要保持良好的身体状态才能拥有健康的体魄。同样地，如果我们身体健康，就 会自然而然地 被 吸引 去 维持 身体的良好状态。健康是我们的身体在某一特定时间的状态。健康状况良好的 真正 标志或许是没有疾病或 残疾 ，但我们的身体仍可能很 虚弱 ，容易成为 病毒 攻击的 目标 。 例 如，我们可能很容易 感冒 。这并不 一定 意味着我们不健康。这意味着我们的健康水平与我们的年龄及所处的 气候条件 不 符 。"
    },
    {
      "num": "03",
      "en": "It is important for {everybody} to {devote} some time to health and fitness.There are some activities which everybody should do in their lives.For instance, we should engage in sports like running, cycling, {tennis} or {golf regardless} of our age and working style.Regular {gymnastics} is a good choice, and going on a {picnic} or {camping} also creates chances for necessary physical activities.Moreover, maintaining a balanced diet rich in {protein} and taking in nutritious foods like {bananas} and {carrots} can support your health and fitness goals by providing essential vitamins and minerals.",
      "cn": "对 每个人 来说，把一些时间 投入 到健康和健身上是很重要的。生活中有些活动是人人都应该参与的。例如， 无论 我们处于什么年龄，工作风格如何，都应该参加像跑步、骑自行车、打 网球 或 高尔夫球 这样的运动。经常做 体操 是一个不错的选择， 野餐 或 露营 也能为必要的体育活动创造机会。此外，保持富含 蛋白质 的均衡饮食，摄入 香蕉 、 胡萝卜 等营养丰富的食物，都能通过提供必需的维生素和矿物质帮助你达到强身健体的目的。"
    },
    {
      "num": "04",
      "en": "{Additionally} , it is important to {relax} our body.While everyone seems to be in a constant {hurry} , we should still have at least six to {eight} hours of {sleep} every day.After all, we wouldn't keep our computers running on low {battery} .Sleep doesn't make us {lazy} .It helps in improving our immune ( (免疫) ) system and protects us against diseases.It also helps in keeping us {calm} and releases {tension} .Otherwise, we become {careless} , making mistakes that could be easily avoided. {Pilots} also need {adequate} sleep to safely navigate through the skies.",
      "cn": "另外 ， 放松 身体也很重要。虽然每个人似乎都一直处于 匆匆忙忙 的状态，但我们仍应每天至少保证六到 八 个小时的 睡眠 。毕竟，我们不会让电脑在低 电量 下运行。睡眠不会让我们变得 懒惰 。它有助于增强我们的免疫系统，保护我们免受疾病侵袭。睡眠还有助于我们保持 冷静 ，释放 压力 。否则，我们就会变得 粗心大意 ，犯下本可轻易避免的错误。就连 飞行员 也需要 充足的 睡眠才能在天空中安全地航行。"
    }
  ],
